// Blueprint — an AI diagram drafter.
// Describe a system, flow or idea in plain words, and it gets drafted as a
// clean technical drawing. UI and rendering live in index.html + src/.

generateText = {import:ai-text-plugin}

$meta
  title = Blueprint Factory — AI Diagram Drafter
  description = Describe anything and get a technical drawing of it: flowcharts, org charts, mind maps, architecture and sequence diagrams, in several drafting styles including hand-drawn.
  header
    mode = minimal

// Example briefs shown as quick-start chips in the UI. Add your own below.
diagramIdeas
  A flowchart showing how a bill becomes a law
  Map the sign-up flow for a mobile banking app
  How a search engine works, from typing a query to showing results
  Org chart for a 20-person indie game studio
  The customer support escalation path in a SaaS company
  How photosynthesis turns sunlight into energy
  Cloud deployment architecture for a realtime chat application
  Sequence of what happens when you press "place order" on a webshop
  Network topology of a small office with servers, printers and Wi-Fi
  How Netflix recommendations are generated for one user
  Emergency response procedure for a fire in an office building
  How a vending machine processes a coin purchase
